* Same, sized for the nominal corner only
* LTspice: File > Open (All files) > this .net > Run.  Keep ptm90.lib in this folder.
* One analysis at a time: un-comment the one you want with ";" removed.
.include ptm90.lib
.temp 35

Vdd vdd 0 dc 1
Cpd in 0 450f
CL out 0 50f
Iin 0 in dc 0 ac 1
Ibn vdd vbn dc 20u
Mdn vbn vbn 0 0 nmos90 W=1u L=200n AD=0.2p AS=0.2p PD=2.4u PS=2.4u
Cbn vbn 0 2p
Mb in vbn 0 0 nmos90 W=4.696u L=200n AD=0.9393p AS=0.9393p PD=9.793u PS=9.793u
M1 d1 x in 0 nmos90 W=3.466u L=100n AD=0.6932p AS=0.6932p PD=7.332u PS=7.332u
M2 x in 0 0 nmos90 W=13.91u L=100n AD=2.782p AS=2.782p PD=28.22u PS=28.22u
R2 vdd x 773.68
Mp1 d1 d1 vdd vdd pmos90 W=2.981u L=100n AD=0.5962p AS=0.5962p PD=6.362u PS=6.362u
Mp2 out d1 vdd vdd pmos90 W=12.66u L=100n AD=2.532p AS=2.532p PD=25.72u PS=25.72u
RL out 0 1.8007k
M3 x d1 s3 0 nmos90 W=3.391u L=100n AD=0.6783p AS=0.6783p PD=7.183u PS=7.183u
R3 s3 0 618.23
C3 s3 0 214.36f

.ac dec 40 1Meg 100G
;.noise V(out) Iin dec 40 1Meg 100G
;.op
;Eye diagram: open the matching _eye.net file instead (transient with a PRBS7 current source).
.meas AC zt0 FIND mag(V(out)) AT 10Meg
.meas AC zpk MAX mag(V(out))
.meas AC f3db WHEN mag(V(out))=zt0/sqrt(2) FALL=1
.backanno
.end
